# Translation updated 2026-08-19

translate es strings:

    # ── Phone ──

    old "Hey, come to my room. I need your help with something."
    new "Oye, ven a mi cuarto. Necesito tu ayuda con algo."

    old "Hey, come over. I have something fun planned with %(pn)s."
    new "Oye, ven aqui. Tengo algo divertido planeado con %(pn)s."

    old "Bring a condom. Trust me, you'll want to be here for this."
    new "Trae un condón. Creeme, vas a querer estar aqui."

    old "Make sure you have a condom. This is going to be fun."
    new "Asegurate de tener un condón. Va a ser divertido."

    old "On my way."
    new "Ya voy."

    old "Hurry up!"
    new "Apurate!"

    old "Seriously? Your loss."
    new "En serio? Tu te lo pierdes."

    # ── Arrival ──

    old "Ok, so... me and %(pn)s have a little bet going. Just play along, ok?"
    new "Ok, entonces... %(pn)s y yo tenemos una apuestita. Solo sigueme el juego, si?"

    old "So, I made a bet with %(pn)s. Don't worry about the details, just follow my lead."
    new "Entonces, hice una apuesta con %(pn)s. No te preocupes por los detalles, solo sigueme."

    old "Ok baby, turn around. And no peeking!"
    new "Ok amor, date la vuelta. Y nada de espiar!"

    old "Alright babe, face the wall. Remember our bet!"
    new "Listo amor, mira a la pared. Recuerda nuestra apuesta!"

    old "Fine. You're going to lose this one."
    new "Bien. Vas a perder esta."

    old "Whatever. Deal."
    new "Lo que sea. Trato hecho."

    old "This is stupid. I'm not going to look."
    new "Esto es estupido. No voy a mirar."

    old "I won't even be tempted. This is easy."
    new "Ni siquiera voy a sentir tentacion. Es facil."

    old "Just... be loud, ok? The louder the better. Trust me."
    new "Solo... haz ruido, si? Entre mas fuerte mejor. Confla en mi."

    old "Make as much noise as you can. You'll see why."
    new "Haz todo el ruido que puedas. Ya vas a ver por que."

    # ── Sex loop ──

    old "I think he's starting to sweat over there."
    new "Creo que esta empezando a sudar alla."

    old "Look at him, he's trying so hard not to turn around."
    new "Miralo, se esta esforzando tanto para no voltear."

    old "He's so close to breaking! Keep going!"
    new "Esta a punto de ceder! Sigue!"

    old "Almost there! He can't take much more of this!"
    new "Casi! No aguanta mucho mas!"

    # ── NPC looks ──

    old "You hear a sharp intake of breath. He couldn't resist any longer."
    new "Escuchas una respiracion brusca. No pudo resistir mas."

    old "HA! I KNEW IT! You couldn't resist, could you?!"
    new "JA! LO SABIA! No pudiste resistirte, verdad?!"

    old "I WIN! You looked! I told you, you can't handle it!"
    new "GANE! Miraste! Te dije, no puedes con esto!"

    old "I... I just... I heard... Fine, you win."
    new "Yo... yo solo... escuche... Bien, ganaste."

    old "It was... the sounds were... Okay, okay, you win!"
    new "Fueron... los sonidos eran... Ok, ok, ganaste!"

    old "And since you lost... the condom comes off. That was the deal."
    new "Y como perdiste... el condón se quita. Ese era el trato."

    old "Loser's punishment... no more condom. A bet is a bet."
    new "Castigo del perdedor... sin condón. Una apuesta es una apuesta."

    old "Damn it... a deal is a deal."
    new "Maldicion... trato es trato."

    old "I knew I shouldn't have taken that bet..."
    new "Sabia que no debi haber aceptado esa apuesta..."

    old "Shhh. You lost. Now sit there and watch properly this time."
    new "Shhh. Perdiste. Ahora sientate ahi y mira bien esta vez."

    old "Too late, baby. You had your chance. Now enjoy the show."
    new "Muy tarde, amor. Tuviste tu oportunidad. Ahora disfruta el show."

    # ── Cum ──

    old "Mmm... that was incredible. And he saw everything."
    new "Mmm... eso fue increible. Y lo vio todo."

    # ── Post win ──

    old "That was amazing. Thanks for helping me win. Did you see his face?"
    new "Eso fue increible. Gracias por ayudarme a ganar. Viste su cara?"

    old "Best bet I ever made. You were perfect. His expression was priceless."
    new "La mejor apuesta que hice. Estuviste perfecto. Su expresion no tenia precio."

    old "I... I need a moment."
    new "Yo... necesito un momento."

    old "I can't believe I lost..."
    new "No puedo creer que perdi..."

    # ── Post lose ──

    old "Well... I guess he won that one. You finished too fast."
    new "Bueno... supongo que gano esa. Acabaste muy rapido."

    old "Ugh, he didn't even flinch. I lost the bet."
    new "Ugh, ni se inmuto. Perdi la apuesta."

    old "Whatever. Let's go watch Super Cuck Man, %(pn)s. You earned it."
    new "Lo que sea. Vamos a ver Super Cuck Man, %(pn)s. Te lo ganaste."

    old "Fine, fine. %(Pp)s can pick the movie tonight. Ugh."
    new "Ya, ya. %(Pp)s puede elegir la pelicula esta noche. Ugh."

    # ── Exhaustion ──

    old "You can't hold it anymore. Your body gives in."
    new "Ya no puedes mas. Tu cuerpo cede."

    # ── Navigation ──

    old "You head to [_bet_girl.Name]'s room."
    new "Te diriges al cuarto de [_bet_girl.Name]."

    # ── Menu items (new only) ──

    old "Pick a position."
    new "Elige una posicion."

